TO THE FULLEST EXTENT PERMITTED BY APPLICABLE LAW, THE COVERED CONTRIBUTIONS
ARE PROVIDED AS IS, WITHOUT EXPRESS, IMPLIED, OR STATUTORY WARRANTIES,
INCLUDING ACCURACY, TITLE, NONINFRINGEMENT, MERCHANTABILITY, OR FITNESS
FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE. TO THAT SAME EXTENT, THE DEDICATOR SHALL NOT BE
LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, LOSS, DAMAGE, OR OTHER LIABILITY ARISING FROM THE
COVERED CONTRIBUTIONS OR THEIR USE, WHETHER IN CONTRACT, TORT, OR OTHERWISE.

No maintenance, correction, explanation, defense, indemnification, or
continued availability is promised.

Third-party rights and prior permissions

This dedication neither releases rights belonging to others nor removes
conditions attached to their material. It grants no trademark rights or
authority to claim endorsement or represent another person or organization.
Mandatory legal obligations remain unaffected.

Existing Apache-2.0 permissions are not withdrawn. LICENSE-APACHE-2.0 preserves
the former license text for material and distributions to which it applies.
Its presence does not imply that unrelated third-party material is Apache
licensed. Nothing here replaces an outside rights holder's license.

Interpretation

If a provision is ineffective, the remainder continues to operate to the
fullest extent permitted by law. No provision introduces an attribution
requirement, payment obligation, or field-of-use restriction on the covered
contributions. This is an independent dedication, not CC0 or a Creative
Commons instrument.

The intended result is unrestricted permission, without an accompanying
claim on the user's attention.
